<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Owens &amp; Minor cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Owens &amp; Minor cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it downgraded Owens &amp; Minor Inc to long-term buy from buy based on price.</p>
<p>-- Said maintained earnings per share estimate of $0.61 a share for 1997, $0.82 a share for 1998, and $0.95 for 1999.</p>
<p>-- Believes price target of $15 represents full value for the next 12-18 months.</p>
<p>-- Owens &amp; Minor lost 1/2 to 14-1/2.</p>
</text>
